---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base
  title="Attestto Ark — Patron Program"
  description="Institutional patronage tiers for the Attestto Ark sovereign digital identity deployment. Founding Patron, Sustaining Patron, Supporting Patron, Institutional Partner."
  canonicalPath="/es/ark/patrons"
  ogTitle="Attestto Ark — Patron Program"
  ogDescription="Institutional patronage tiers for the Ark sovereign digital identity deployment."
  navVariant="default"
  footerVariant="default"
  lang="es"
>

  <section class="hero hero-single">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-text" style="max-width: 65ch;">
        <h1>Patron Program</h1>
        <p class="lead">Institutional patronage of the Ark sovereign digital identity deployment, in the museum and scientific-expedition tradition. Discretion is the value. Scarcity is the value.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">Tiers</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Four levels of recognition</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Each tier carries a fixed contribution and a fixed form of recognition. There is no editorial control, no governance seat, no architectural influence, and no negotiation on price. Recognition is permanent or annual, depending on tier.</p>

      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">&#9733;</div>
          <h3>Founding Patron</h3>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-accent); margin: 0.5rem 0;">USD 1,000,000</p>
          <p>Permanent recognition. Genesis ceremony recording title card credit, Ark architecture page footer credit, technical whitepaper preface acknowledgment, and permanent credit in every annual report.</p>
          <div class="detail-box">
            <div><span class="hl">Slots:</span> Two to three, total, for the lifetime of the project</div>
            <div><span class="hl">Lifetime:</span> Permanent</div>
            <div><span class="hl">Retroactive:</span> Not available after the genesis ceremony is filmed</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">&#9711;</div>
          <h3>Sustaining Patron</h3>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-accent); margin: 0.5rem 0;">USD 500,000</p>
          <p>Annual recognition. Architecture page footer credit for the current year, plus acknowledgment in the technical whitepaper preface.</p>
          <div class="detail-box">
            <div><span class="hl">Slots:</span> Five per year, refreshed annually</div>
            <div><span class="hl">Lifetime:</span> Twelve months, renewable</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">&#9678;</div>
          <h3>Supporting Patron</h3>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-accent); margin: 0.5rem 0;">USD 250,000</p>
          <p>Annual recognition. Acknowledgment in the technical whitepaper preface and the annual report.</p>
          <div class="detail-box">
            <div><span class="hl">Slots:</span> No fixed cap. Each contribution is reviewed individually for institutional alignment.</div>
            <div><span class="hl">Lifetime:</span> Twelve months</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">&#9675;</div>
          <h3>Institutional Partner</h3>
          <p style="font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-accent); margin: 0.5rem 0;">USD 100,000 / year</p>
          <p>Annual recurring recognition. Acknowledgment in the annual report.</p>
          <div class="detail-box">
            <div><span class="hl">Slots:</span> No fixed cap</div>
            <div><span class="hl">Lifetime:</span> Annual, recurring</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">Principles</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">What patronage means here</h2>

      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Discretion is enforced</h3>
          <p>Patron credit appears in the footer, the title card, the preface, and the annual report. There are no large logos, no badge walls, no homepage carousels, and no "powered by" headers. Readers who care about credit will find it. Readers who do not care will not be distracted by it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>No control, ever</h3>
          <p>The Patron is acquiring the right to say "we supported this", not the right to shape it. There is no editorial control on the case study or the ceremony recording. There is no governance seat. There is no architectural influence. There is no veto. This is the same firewall a museum maintains between donors and curators.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>No retroactive credit</h3>
          <p>The genesis ceremony is a one-time event with one-time credits. A Founding Patron position for the Costa Rica genesis ceremony is available only until the ceremony is filmed. After that, the position is no longer available at any price.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-light cta-center">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">Inquire</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Contact the program</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">Patron contributions are arranged directly. There is no application form. Inquiries are answered within seven days.</p>
      <a href="mailto:open@attestto.com?subject=Ark%20Patron%20Program%20%E2%80%94%20Inquiry" class="btn btn-primary">open@attestto.com</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Base>
